<break time="600ms"/>
goal setting for joy set small, achievable goals that bring fulfillment, not just external validation.
<break time="600ms"/>
make some time to do something i enjoy like ….
<break time="600ms"/>
finally schedule that ….
<break time="600ms"/>
start that book or show i’ve been wanting to check out: ….
<break time="600ms"/>
call … just to laugh together.
<break time="600ms"/>
go outside and … with no guilt.
<break time="600ms"/>
buy myself … without waiting for permission.
<break time="600ms"/>
say no to … so i can say yes to rest.
<break time="600ms"/>
spend an afternoon doing … just because it makes me happy.
<break time="600ms"/>
what am i really trying to prove with my achievements, and to whom?
